Main findings:
1. Exact equivalents from the CA structure:
   - the symmetry class: rule 86 from a black seed gives c; rules 135 and 149 from a white seed give NOT c;
   - an infinite family of finite seeds with exactly the same center column: 1, 11, 101, 1011, ... (OR latch; new as far as I found);
